NERC Training Expiration Notification
1. Requirement and architecture
Enhance the existing notification process to warn users 30, 15 and 7 days before training expiration, only when they hold an entitlement whose requiredCourse contains the expiring course and whose revokeOnExpTraining flag is enabled. The notification process does not revoke access; existing enforcement remains separate.
