3.5 Scan-only and email processing
With scanOnly=true, training and access evaluation proceed but email submission is bypassed. With scanOnly=false and the safety guard permitting sending, the rule loads PGE-EmailTemplate-Training-Warning, constructs EmailOptions and template arguments, optionally CCs the identity manager, and calls context.sendEmailNotification(template, options). A successful send call increments emailsSent, but does not prove SMTP delivery.
